# Web Workers

Тяжёлые вычисления — в workers, не в main thread.

## Файлы

- `public/workers/` — chart, stats, map, leaderboard, export workers (plain JS)
- `components/workers/WorkersManager.tsx` — singleton `WorkersManager` class
- `components/workers/ClientWorkersManager.tsx` — React-обёртка

## Паттерн

```typescript
const manager = WorkersManager.getInstance();
const result = await manager.runStatsWorker(payload);
```

## Новый worker

1. Добавь `public/workers/my-worker.js`
2. Метод в `WorkersManager` + тип payload/result
3. Co-located тест `public/workers/my-worker.test.js`

## Export

Экспорт CSV/JSON/HTML/PDF — через `export-worker.js` и `ExportButton`.
